Subject: [PATCH] ppc64le platform: pacman templates, runtime profile, mise overlay

pacman-stable.conf and mirrorlist-stable for both POWER platforms: our pool
(and the POWER9 pool first on ppc64le-power9), then Arch POWER's base-any
and base. Architecture is powerpc64le, not auto, which resolves to ppc64le.
default/mise/aqua-powerpc64.yaml is the aqua registry overlay POWER's mise
fragment names: agent CLIs mapped to their arm64 builds, uv to its native one.

Generated from the ppc64le-platform branch (v4.5.0 + 380bd7170 "Add the
ppc64le platform", 296d4d7ee "Refuse an unsupported CPU instead of calling
it x86" and 53bfb9e91 "Run agent CLIs with no POWER build as their arm64
builds") with:

    git diff v4.5.0..ppc64le-platform -- default/

Paths are upstream's git paths. The PKGBUILD applies it with
patch -p1 -d "$pkgdir/usr/share/omarchy", which lands them on the installed layout.

diff --git a/default/mise/aqua-powerpc64.yaml b/default/mise/aqua-powerpc64.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..27fbbe43f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/default/mise/aqua-powerpc64.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,646 @@
+# aqua registry overlay for mise on linux/ppc64le (mise names the arch "powerpc64").
+# Each package below replaces mise's bundled aqua recipe of the same name, with
+# powerpc64 mapped to whatever the recipe renders for arm64, so mise fetches the
+# linux/arm64 build; POWERarm runs it through binfmt_misc. Packages not listed
+# here keep mise's bundled recipe. Inert on other arches, but ship it only on
+# ppc64le: a frozen copy also freezes the recipe.
+#
+# Source: aquaproj/aqua-registry @ e1ad0a5bc74f58112b054dfeef19f5659ddf1300 (2026-11-16),
+#   pkgs/<owner>/<name>/registry.yaml for:
+#   anthropics/claude-code openai/codex github/copilot-cli google-antigravity/antigravity-cli
+#   OpenRouterLabs/ori-releases earendil-works/pi modem-dev/hunk
+#   anomalyco/opencode  (used only if opencode is aliased to aqua:anomalyco/opencode)
+#   astral-sh/uv: NOT remapped to arm64. Astral publishes a native ppc64le build
+#   (uv-powerpc64le-unknown-linux-gnu) that the stock recipe never names, so its
+#   linux/powerpc64 override fetches that instead.
+# Generated by (recipe files saved as <owner>_<name>.yaml):
+#   aqua-powerpc64-overlay.py aqua-powerpc64.yaml anthropics_claude-code.yaml \
+#     openai_codex.yaml github_copilot-cli.yaml google-antigravity_antigravity-cli.yaml \
+#     OpenRouterLabs_ori-releases.yaml earendil-works_pi.yaml modem-dev_hunk.yaml \
+#     anomalyco_opencode.yaml
+# Regenerate whenever one of these recipes changes upstream.
+
